{"id":"b302fbb2f57ac12b","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-lem-chain-hyp.md","title":"Chain Condition Hypothesis","display":"lem-chain-hyp — Chain Condition Hypothesis","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-chain-hyp","aliases":["58-lem-chain-hyp"],"display":"lem-chain-hyp — Chain Condition Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-chain-hyp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-chain-hyp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-chain-hyp — Chain Condition Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(M,P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the typed predicates from dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> is the fixed membership-language theory ZFC without Power Set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}(v_0)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}(v_0)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}^{(1)}\\)</span> is a fixed formula saying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is a cardinal</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}hyp} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\n\\land P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda,\\check\\lambda\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P\\mathbf1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\lambda,P)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}},\\langle\\check\\lambda\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}hyp} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\n\\land P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda,\\check\\lambda\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P\\mathbf1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\lambda,P)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}},\\langle\\check\\lambda\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order, top condition, ground model, formula code, and name tuple are explicit, matching the canonical forcing-relation arity.</li>\n<li>This is the c.c.c. cardinal-preservation lemma for a ground-model cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}(v_0)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}chain\\text{-}hyp} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-})\n\\land P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\lambda,\\check\\lambda\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(p\\leq_P\\mathbf1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check\\lambda,P)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}},\\langle\\check\\lambda\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3878","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-lem-chain-hyp.md|58-lem-chain-hyp]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","ec28b62254928d73","937fc0dd4cc72948","5fb1c2241d1943d1","46b2495f214783c3","65418b505fc53093"]}